---
description: SoulTrace shop scope, safety and brand constraints
alwaysApply: true
---
Read README.md and docs/INTEGRATION.md first. Preserve working behavior and test it.
The current project is a static frontend DEMO. Never claim checkout, archive API or authentication is live.
Do not silently replace the stack. Products and options live in src/catalog.mjs.
Confirmed user prices: nfc 9900, letter 24900, minibook 49900 KRW. Display order is memory card first. Letter set items: 편지 · 엽서 · NFC 인식표.
Actual server catalog/quote must govern real transactions. Never trust client prices or totals.
No frontend secrets, service-role credentials, fake reviews, false shipping promises or fabricated legal details.
Never store personal photos, letters, names, addresses or tokens in localStorage or URLs.
Language preference (ko/en) may be stored. Default UI is Korean. English UI must keep KRW, never convert to USD.
No analytics, external fonts, ad pixels, scraping or model training without explicit approval and privacy review.
Use the supplied images as concept assets, not as proof of shipped products or final manufacturing specifications.
Keep inferred product options and unconfirmed shipping/production policies clearly marked.
Do not activate paid orders until authentication, ownership checks, quote validation, payment verification,
idempotency, shipping rules, legal business information and final policies are implemented and tested.
Run npm run check after code changes. Build regenerates preview.html; edit src, not generated preview.html.
